  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original three-dimensional lobe-finned fish skull with large spiracular openings. No full fish, fin or shoulder reconstruction; no flattened slab proxy. [\"Bilateral reconstruction of incomplete dorsal material is explicit symmetry inference.\", \"Exact sutural paths simplified; preservation breaks are not all anatomical sutures.\", \"Approximate55mm envelope is figure-scaled, not independently measured museum specimen.\", \"Do not use comparison taxa Fig1f/h as Gogonasus. Panelg alone is its isolated palatoquadrate.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"skull_envelope_length_m\": 0.055, \"status\": \"Approximate figure-derived reference envelope, not a published direct measurement. Fig1a from rear to snout spans about5.4 times its 1cm scale bar, rounded55mm.\", \"measurement_basis\": \"Official Fig1 rendered600px wide: scale bar about99px, lateral skull envelope about540px.\", \"estimated_width_m\": 0.03, \"estimated_height_m\": 0.025, \"uncertainty\": \"Envelope width/depth are inferred from available oblique/lateral and partial dorsal references; not scan precision.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original three-dimensional lobe-finned fish skull with large spiracular openings. No full fish, fin or shoulder reconstruction; no flattened slab proxy. [\"Bilateral reconstruction of incomplete dorsal material is explicit symmetry inference.\", \"Exact sutural paths simplified; preservation breaks are not all anatomical sutures.\", \"Approximate55mm envelope is figure-scaled, not independently measured museum specimen.\", \"Do not use comparison taxa Fig1f/h as Gogonasus. Panelg alone is its isolated palatoquadrate.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"skull_envelope_length_m\": 0.055, \"status\": \"Approximate figure-derived reference envelope, not a published direct measurement. Fig1a from rear to snout spans about5.4 times its 1cm scale bar, rounded55mm.\", \"measurement_basis\": \"Official Fig1 rendered600px wide: scale bar about99px, lateral skull envelope about540px.\", \"estimated_width_m\": 0.03, \"estimated_height_m\": 0.025, \"uncertainty\": \"Envelope width/depth are inferred from available oblique/lateral and partial dorsal references; not scan precision.\"}"
  },
